{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>本港地區明日（23日，周一）天氣預測：多雲，有一兩陣雨。氣溫介乎20°C至23°C。吹和緩偏東風，初時風勢清勁，離岸及高地間中吹強風，風勢有時疾勁。展望周二（24日）轉吹偏北風，天氣轉涼，初時雨勢較為頻密。周三（25日）及周四（26日）早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16°C左右，新界再低兩三度。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:43:53.069856+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:11:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:45:09.007226+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T11:37:25.592437+00:00","content_hash":"a426a0672e4425873313775491a6143369c2a584a4c64e0d854f05592e3ab633","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}